ct\n- [ ] **Startup script cleanup** — log directory path still uses old default, redundant `ROS_AUTOMATIC_DISCOVERY_RANGE` exports\n\n### Operator Tools\n- [ ] **Operator logbook rqt plugin** — [rqt_operator_tools#1](https://github.com/rolker/rqt_operator_tools/issues/1), design in [unh_marine_autonomy#114](https://github.com/rolker/unh_marine_autonomy/issues/114), draft plan in [rqt_operator_tools#2](https://github.com/rolker/rqt_operator_tools/pull/2)\n- [ ] **Pre-launch checklist plugin** — [unh_marine_autonomy#113](https://github.com/rolker/unh_marine_autonomy/issues/113) (design only, no implementation yet)\n- [ ] **Operator dashboard** — real-time vitals display: connection status, RTK fix quality, battery level, WAN/cellular status, WireGuard tunnel health\n- [ ] **Stale image indicator** — colored border around camera views that changes based on freshness (green → yellow at ~2s, red at ~5s), similar to CAMP heartbeat display\n\n### Related Open Issues\n- #18 — Write deployment guide\n- #28 — Refactor operator launch files to be generic\n- #12 — Rename network device identities\n- CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#6 — Site-specific configuration\n- CCOMJHC/ccomjhc_project11#15 — Streamline DNS naming","files":null}]}